    "sub_name": "品牌關係經營實務研究",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICAL RESEARCH ON BRAND RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "引導學生學習如何使用行銷研究方法來撰寫研究報告。主要內容包括研究背景、研究動機、研究目標、文獻回顧、研究架構、研究流程圖、研究設計、數據收集及基本統計方法。此外，研究主題將與品牌關係經營相關。",
    "describe_eh": "Students are guided to learn how to use marketing research methodology to write a research report. The main contents include research background, research motivation, research objectives, literature review, research framework, research flowchart, research design, data collection and basic statistical methods. In addition, the research topic will be related to brand relationship management.",
